    {
        "title" : "LangMem 基本概念介紹",
        "date_published" : "2025-05-04T00:00:00Z",
        "date_modified" : "2025-05-04T00:00:00Z",
        "id" : "http://localhost:1313/other/langmem-intro/",
        "url" : "http://localhost:1313/other/langmem-intro/",
        "content_html" : "\u003ch2 id=\"前言\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#%e5%89%8d%e8%a8%80\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e1 前言\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e本篇文章為 DeepLearning.AI 所開設的 \u003ca href=\"https://www.deeplearning.ai/short-courses/long-term-agentic-memory-with-langgraph/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eLong-Term Agentic Memory with LangGraph\u003c/a\u003e 課程筆記。希望讀者能夠透過本篇文章，理解 Agent Memory 的基本概念，以及如何透過 \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langmem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eLangMem\u003c/a\u003e 實踐 Agent Memory！\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"為什麼-agent-需要-memory\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#%e7%82%ba%e4%bb%80%e9%ba%bc-agent-%e9%9c%80%e8%a6%81-memory\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e2 為什麼 Agent 需要 Memory\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e了解 Agent 的 Memory 之前，我們先思考這個問題：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n  \u003cp\u003e為什麼 Agent 需要 Memory ?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cp\u003e作者舉一個能夠自動回覆 Email 的 Agent 來說明。如下圖示，這個 LLM 需要在讀取信件內容後，透過 Tool Calling 查看收件者的行事曆 (Calendar Tool)，再透過 Tool Calling 進行 Email 內容的撰寫 (Email Writing Tool)：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/other/langmem-intro/email-agent.png\" title=\"\" data-thumbnail=\"/other/langmem-intro/email-agent.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003e一個能夠自動回覆 Email 的 Agent\u003c/h2\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src='/other/langmem-intro/email-agent.png' srcset=\"/other/langmem-intro/email-agent_hu_13132d1518951b0b.webp 800w, /other/langmem-intro/email-agent_hu_3c1eef68dc49ff67.webp 1200w, /other/langmem-intro/email-agent_hu_edb60f88b731f4d.webp 1600w\"   height=\"411\" width=\"1254\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003e一個能夠自動回覆 Email 的 Agent\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n    \u003c/figure\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e在這個過程中，LLM 需要過去的經驗，幫助它克服一些挑戰。如下圖中的紅字所述：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/other/langmem-intro/email-agent-challenge.png\" title=\"\" data-thumbnail=\"/other/langmem-intro/email-agent-challenge.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003eEmail Agent 會遇到的挑戰\u003c/h2\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src='/other/langmem-intro/email-agent-challenge.png' srcset=\"/other/langmem-intro/email-agent-challenge_hu_8ffbd4f07bd70996.webp 800w, /other/langmem-intro/email-agent-challenge_hu_39676c1d1d3e5189.webp 1200w, /other/langmem-intro/email-agent-challenge_hu_72e9e07f847dc600.webp 1600w\"   height=\"362\" width=\"1363\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003eEmail Agent 會遇到的挑戰\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n    \u003c/figure\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e如果 Agent 有記憶能力 (Memory)，就能夠參考過去的經驗來處理新的任務。如此一來，Agent 就能夠隨著處理的任務愈多，收集到愈多經驗，而變得更厲害。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"memory-的類型以及運作時機\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#memory-%e7%9a%84%e9%a1%9e%e5%9e%8b%e4%bb%a5%e5%8f%8a%e9%81%8b%e4%bd%9c%e6%99%82%e6%a9%9f\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e3 Memory 的類型以及運作時機\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eAgent 的 Memory 主要可以分為三種類型:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/other/langmem-intro/memory-type.png\" title=\"\" data-thumbnail=\"/other/langmem-intro/memory-type.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003eAgent Memory 的類型\u003c/h2\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src='/other/langmem-intro/memory-type.png' srcset=\"/other/langmem-intro/memory-type_hu_583406519e459b91.webp 800w, /other/langmem-intro/memory-type_hu_7a54b1f913768af7.webp 1200w, /other/langmem-intro/memory-type_hu_6d08a476142d07f7.webp 1600w\"   height=\"397\" width=\"1898\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003eAgent Memory 的類型\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n    \u003c/figure\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSemantic Memory: 存放與「事實」相關的內容（我覺得以廣義來說「文件」也可以當成這個類別）\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEpisodic Memory: 存放與「經驗」相關的內容（Ex. 放在 Prompt 中的 Few-Shot Examples）\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eProcedural Memory: 存放與「指令」相關的內容（Ex. 給 LLM 的 System Prompt）\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e而 Agent Memory 的運作時機主要有兩種：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/other/langmem-intro/memory-work.png\" title=\"\" data-thumbnail=\"/other/langmem-intro/memory-work.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003eAgent Memory 的類型\u003c/h2\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src='/other/langmem-intro/memory-work.png' srcset=\"/other/langmem-intro/memory-work_hu_aa40d717a6ac7dae.webp 800w, /other/langmem-intro/memory-work_hu_9d37437f308f085e.webp 1200w, /other/langmem-intro/memory-work_hu_41a1c5d5d813e47e.webp 1600w\"   height=\"479\" width=\"1092\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003eAgent Memory 的類型\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n    \u003c/figure\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIn the hot path: 在收到 User 的每次 Query 時都會進行 Memory 的讀取與寫入\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIn the background: 在 Agent 的運行過程中，會定期進行 Memory 的讀取與寫入\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"email-agent-w--wo-memory\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#email-agent-w--wo-memory\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e4 Email Agent w/ \u0026amp; w/o Memory\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e理解了 Agent Memory 的基本概念後，我們來看看在 Email Agent 中，Memory 的運作方式。下圖為一個基本的 Email Agent，沒有使用 Memory 的情況下的 Worflow:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/other/langmem-intro/email-agent-wo-memory.png\" title=\"\" data-thumbnail=\"/other/langmem-intro/email-agent-wo-memory.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003eEmail Agent 沒有 Memory\u003c/h2\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src='/other/langmem-intro/email-agent-wo-memory.png' srcset=\"/other/langmem-intro/email-agent-wo-memory_hu_6adc15f4861a2950.webp 800w, /other/langmem-intro/email-agent-wo-memory_hu_958f2fc74091af82.webp 1200w, /other/langmem-intro/email-agent-wo-memory_hu_6675bcdea85412ca.webp 1600w\"   height=\"377\" width=\"1350\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003eEmail Agent 沒有 Memory\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n    \u003c/figure\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e而下圖為一個使用 Memory 的 Email Agent 的 Workflow:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/other/langmem-intro/email-agent-w-memory.png\" title=\"\" data-thumbnail=\"/other/langmem-intro/email-agent-w-memory.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003eEmail Agent 有 Memory\u003c/h2\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src='/other/langmem-intro/email-agent-w-memory.png' srcset=\"/other/langmem-intro/email-agent-w-memory_hu_9a765b7b7728fed3.webp 800w, /other/langmem-intro/email-agent-w-memory_hu_67d2ea8f8f734ebd.webp 1200w, /other/langmem-intro/email-agent-w-memory_hu_3eb03c0175d6892e.webp 1600w\"   height=\"485\" width=\"1334\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003eEmail Agent 有 Memory\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n    \u003c/figure\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e可以發現到：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEpisodic Memory: 其實就是放在 Prompt 中的 Few-Shot Examples，幫助 LLM 判斷這個 Email 是否需要回覆\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eProcedural Memory: 其實就是寫在 LLM 的 System Prompt 中的內容，告訴 LLM 如何使用 Calandar Tool 以及 Email Writing Tool\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSemantic Memory: 存放既定的事實 (Ex. Response Preference)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"email-agent-的實做-不具備-memory\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#email-agent-%e7%9a%84%e5%af%a6%e5%81%9a-%e4%b8%8d%e5%85%b7%e5%82%99-memory\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e5 Email Agent 的實做 (不具備 Memory)\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e接著，先實做一個基本的 Email Agent，這個 Agent 不具備 Memory 的功能:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/other/langmem-intro/email-agent-wo-memory.png\" title=\"\" data-thumbnail=\"/other/langmem-intro/email-agent-wo-memory.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003eEmail Agent 沒有 Memory\u003c/h2\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src='/other/langmem-intro/email-agent-wo-memory.png' srcset=\"/other/langmem-intro/email-agent-wo-memory_hu_6adc15f4861a2950.webp 800w, /other/langmem-intro/email-agent-wo-memory_hu_958f2fc74091af82.webp 1200w, /other/langmem-intro/email-agent-wo-memory_hu_6675bcdea85412ca.webp 1600w\"   height=\"377\" width=\"1350\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003eEmail Agent 沒有 Memory\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n    \u003c/figure\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"triage-的實做\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#triage-%e7%9a%84%e5%af%a6%e5%81%9a\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e5.1 Triage 的實做\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eTriage 基本上就是透過 LLM 來對目前的郵件進行分類，分為三類：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eignore: 忽略這封郵件\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003enotify: 這封郵件是重要的資訊，但不需要回覆\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003erespond: 這封郵件需要回覆\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"code-block highlight is-open show-line-numbers  tw-group tw-my-2\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"\n    \n    tw-flex \n    tw-flex-row\n    tw-flex-1 \n    tw-justify-between \n    tw-w-full tw-bg-bgColor-secondary\n    \"\u003e      \n    \u003cbutton \n      class=\"\n        code-block-button\n        tw-mx-2 \n        tw-flex\n        tw-flex-row\n        tw-flex-1\"\n      aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"group-[.is-open]:tw-rotate-90 tw-transition-[transform] tw-duration-500 tw-ease-in-out print:!tw-hidden tw-w-min tw-h-min tw-my-1 tw-mx-1\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M285.476 272.971L91.132 467.314c-9.373 9.373-24.569 9.373-33.941 0l-22.667-22.667c-9.357-9.357-9.375-24.522-.04-33.901L188.505 256 34.484 101.255c-9.335-9.379-9.317-24.544.04-33.901l22.667-22.667c9.373-9.373 24.569-9.373 33.941 0L285.475 239.03c9.373 9.372 9.373 24.568.001 33.941z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cp class=\"tw-select-none !tw-my-1\"\u003epython\u003c/p\u003e\n      \u003c/button\u003e\n\n   \u003cdiv class=\"tw-flex\"\u003e\n      \u003cbutton \n        class=\"\n          line-number-button\n          tw-mx-2 \n          tw-hidden \n          group-[.is-open]:tw-block \n          group-[.show-line-numbers]:tw-text-fgColor-link \n          print:!tw-hidden\" \n        title=\"Toggle line numbers\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M61.77 401l17.5-20.15a19.92 19.92 0 0 0 5.07-14.19v-3.31C84.34 356 80.5 352 73 352H16a8 8 0 0 0-8 8v16a8 8 0 0 0 8 8h22.83a157.41 157.41 0 0 0-11 12.31l-5.61 7c-4 5.07-5.25 10.13-2.8 14.88l1.05 1.93c3 5.76 6.29 7.88 12.25 7.88h4.73c10.33 0 15.94 2.44 15.94 9.09 0 4.72-4.2 8.22-14.36 8.22a41.54 41.54 0 0 1-15.47-3.12c-6.49-3.88-11.74-3.5-15.6 3.12l-5.59 9.31c-3.72 6.13-3.19 11.72 2.63 15.94 7.71 4.69 20.38 9.44 37 9.44 34.16 0 48.5-22.75 48.5-44.12-.03-14.38-9.12-29.76-28.73-34.88zM496 224H176a16 16 0 0 0-16 16v32a16 16 0 0 0 16 16h320a16 16 0 0 0 16-16v-32a16 16 0 0 0-16-16zm0-160H176a16 16 0 0 0-16 16v32a16 16 0 0 0 16 16h320a16 16 0 0 0 16-16V80a16 16 0 0 0-16-16zm0 320H176a16 16 0 0 0-16 16v32a16 16 0 0 0 16 16h320a16 16 0 0 0 16-16v-32a16 16 0 0 0-16-16zM16 160h64a8 8 0 0 0 8-8v-16a8 8 0 0 0-8-8H64V40a8 8 0 0 0-8-8H32a8 8 0 0 0-7.14 4.42l-8 16A8 8 0 0 0 24 64h8v64H16a8 8 0 0 0-8 8v16a8 8 0 0 0 8 8zm-3.91 160H80a8 8 0 0 0 8-8v-16a8 8 0 0 0-8-8H41.32c3.29-10.29 48.34-18.68 48.34-56.44 0-29.06-25-39.56-44.47-39.56-21.36 0-33.8 10-40.46 18.75-4.37 5.59-3 10.84 2.8 15.37l8.58 6.88c5.61 4.56 11 2.47 16.12-2.44a13.44 13.44 0 0 1 9.46-3.84c3.33 0 9.28 1.56 9.28 8.75C51 248.19 0 257.31 0 304.59v4C0 316 5.08 320 12.09 320z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/button\u003e\n\n      \u003cbutton \n        class=\"\n          wrap-code-button\n          tw-select-none \n          tw-mx-2 \n          tw-hidden \n          group-[.is-open]:tw-block \n          group-[.is-wrap]:tw-text-fgColor-link \n          print:!tw-hidden\" \n        title=\"Toggle code wrap\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M16 132h416c8.837 0 16-7.163 16-16V76c0-8.837-7.163-16-16-16H16C7.163 60 0 67.163 0 76v40c0 8.837 7.163 16 16 16zm0 160h416c8.837 0 16-7.163 16-16v-40c0-8.837-7.163-16-16-16H16c-8.837 0-16 7.163-16 16v40c0 8.837 7.163 16 16 16zm0 160h416c8.837 0 16-7.163 16-16v-40c0-8.837-7.163-16-16-16H16c-8.837 0-16 7.163-16 16v40c0 8.837 7.163 16 16 16z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/button\u003e\n      \n      \u003cbutton \n        class=\"\n          copy-code-button\n          tw-select-none\n          tw-mx-2 \n          tw-hidden\n          group-[.is-open]:tw-block\n          hover:tw-text-fgColor-link \n          print:!tw-hidden\"\n        title=\"Copy code\"\u003e\n          \u003cspan class=\"copy-icon tw-block\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M433.941 65.941l-51.882-51.882A48 48 0 0 0 348.118 0H176c-26.51 0-48 21.49-48 48v48H48c-26.51 0-48 21.49-48 48v320c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h224c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48v-48h80c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48V99.882a48 48 0 0 0-14.059-33.941zM266 464H54a6 6 0 0 1-6-6V150a6 6 0 0 1 6-6h74v224c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h96v42a6 6 0 0 1-6 6zm128-96H182a6 6 0 0 1-6-6V54a6 6 0 0 1 6-6h106v88c0 13.255 10.745 24 24 24h88v202a6 6 0 0 1-6 6zm6-256h-64V48h9.632c1.591 0 3.117.632 4.243 1.757l48.368 48.368a6 6 0 0 1 1.757 4.243V112z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n          \u003cspan class=\"check-icon tw-hidden\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n      \u003c/button\u003e\n        \n      \u003cbutton \n        class=\"\n          tw-select-none \n          tw-mx-2 \n          tw-block \n          group-[.is-open]:tw-hidden \n          print:!tw-hidden\" \n        disabled\n        aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M328 256c0 39.8-32.2 72-72 72s-72-32.2-72-72 32.2-72 72-72 72 32.2 72 72zm104-72c-39.8 0-72 32.2-72 72s32.2 72 72 72 72-32.2 72-72-32.2-72-72-72zm-352 0c-39.8 0-72 32.2-72 72s32.2 72 72 72 72-32.2 72-72-32.2-72-72-72z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/button\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003cpre style=\"counter-reset: codeblock;\" class=\"tw-block tw-m-0 tw-p-0\"\u003e\u003ccode \n    id=\"codeblock-id-1\" \n    class=\"\n      chroma \n      !tw-block \n      tw-p-0\n      tw-m-0\n      tw-transition-[max-height] \n      tw-duration-500 \n      tw-ease-in-out \n      group-[.is-closed]:!tw-max-h-0 \n      group-[.is-wrap]:tw-text-wrap\n      tw-overflow-y-hidden\n      tw-overflow-x-auto\n      tw-scrollbar-thin\n      \"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"kn\"\u003efrom\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"nn\"\u003epydantic\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"kn\"\u003eimport\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003eBaseModel\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e,\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003eField\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"kn\"\u003efrom\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"nn\"\u003etyping_extensions\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"kn\"\u003eimport\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003eTypedDict\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e,\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003eLiteral\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e,\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003eAnnotated\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"kn\"\u003efrom\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"nn\"\u003elangchain.chat_models\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"kn\"\u003eimport\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003einit_chat_model\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003ellm\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003einit_chat_model\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e\u0026#34;openai:gpt-4o-mini\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"k\"\u003eclass\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"nc\"\u003eRouter\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003eBaseModel\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e):\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e    \u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e\u0026#34;\u0026#34;\u0026#34;Analyze the unread email and route it according to its content.\u0026#34;\u0026#34;\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e    \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003ereasoning\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e:\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"nb\"\u003estr\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003eField\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e        \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003edescription\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e\u0026#34;Step-by-step reasoning behind the classification.\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e    \u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e    \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003eclassification\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e:\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003eLiteral\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e[\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e\u0026#34;ignore\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e,\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e\u0026#34;respond\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e,\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e\u0026#34;notify\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e]\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003eField\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e        \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003edescription\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e\u0026#34;The classification of an email: \u0026#39;ignore\u0026#39; for irrelevant emails, \u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e        \u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e\u0026#34;\u0026#39;notify\u0026#39; for important information that doesn\u0026#39;t need a response, \u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e        \u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e\u0026#34;\u0026#39;respond\u0026#39; for emails that need a reply\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e,\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e    \u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003ellm_router\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003ellm\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003ewith_structured_output\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003eRouter\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"details admonition tip open\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"details-summary admonition-title\"\u003e\n        \u003cspan class=\"icon\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 352 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M96.06 454.35c.01 6.29 1.87 12.45 5.36 17.69l17.09 25.69a31.99 31.99 0 0 0 26.64 14.28h61.71a31.99 31.99 0 0 0 26.64-14.28l17.09-25.69a31.989 31.989 0 0 0 5.36-17.69l.04-38.35H96.01l.05 38.35zM0 176c0 44.37 16.45 84.85 43.56 115.78 16.52 18.85 42.36 58.23 52.21 91.45.04.26.07.52.11.78h160.24c.04-.26.07-.51.11-.78 9.85-33.22 35.69-72.6 52.21-91.45C335.55 260.85 352 220.37 352 176 352 78.61 272.91-.3 175.45 0 73.44.31 0 82.97 0 176zm176-80c-44.11 0-80 35.89-80 80 0 8.84-7.16 16-16 16s-16-7.16-16-16c0-61.76 50.24-112 112-112 8.84 0 16 7.16 16 16s-7.16 16-16 16z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/span\u003e技巧\u003cspan class=\"details-icon\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"details-content\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"admonition-content\"\u003e比較有趣的是，作者這邊是透過 \u003ccode\u003epydantic\u003c/code\u003e 來定義這個 Router 的結構化輸出，這樣的做法可以讓 LLM 的輸出更具結構性，並且能夠更方便地進行後續的處理。除了 LangChain 支援這樣的作法之外，\u003ca href=\"https://github.com/dottxt-ai/outlines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eoutlines\u003c/a\u003e 也是一個讓 LLM 進行 Structured Text Generation 的選擇。\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ccode\u003ellm_router\u003c/code\u003e 的實際使用方式如下：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"code-block highlight is-open show-line-numbers  tw-group tw-my-2\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"\n    \n    tw-flex \n    tw-flex-row\n    tw-flex-1 \n    tw-justify-between \n    tw-w-full tw-bg-bgColor-secondary\n    \"\u003e      \n    \u003cbutton \n      class=\"\n        code-block-button\n        tw-mx-2 \n        tw-flex\n        tw-flex-row\n        tw-flex-1\"\n      aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"group-[.is-open]:tw-rotate-90 tw-transition-[transform] tw-duration-500 tw-ease-in-out print:!tw-hidden tw-w-min tw-h-min tw-my-1 tw-mx-1\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M285.476 272.971L91.132 467.314c-9.373 9.373-24.569 9.373-33.941 0l-22.667-22.667c-9.357-9.357-9.375-24.522-.04-33.901L188.505 256 34.484 101.255c-9.335-9.379-9.317-24.544.04-33.901l22.667-22.667c9.373-9.373 24.569-9.373 33.941 0L285.475 239.03c9.373 9.372 9.373 24.568.001 33.941z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cp class=\"tw-select-none !tw-my-1\"\u003epython\u003c/p\u003e\n      \u003c/button\u003e\n\n   \u003cdiv class=\"tw-flex\"\u003e\n      \u003cbutton \n        class=\"\n          line-number-button\n          tw-mx-2 \n          tw-hidden \n          group-[.is-open]:tw-block \n          group-[.show-line-numbers]:tw-text-fgColor-link \n          print:!tw-hidden\" \n        title=\"Toggle line numbers\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/